            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a movable charging vehicle (10) comprising a platform (9, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 19) for supporting charging vehicle modules (40, 41, 42, 43, 44, 45, 20, 21, 30), a battery module comprising electrical batteries (40, 41, 42, 43, 44, 45), a power converter module comprising a converter device (20, 21) electrically connected to the one or more electrical batteries (40, 41, 42, 43, 44, 45), the converter device being configured to convert the direct current to alternating current, a power distribution unit (30) comprising a power outlet (33) electrically connected to the converter device (20, 21), and the platform (9, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 19) comprises a thermally insulated battery chamber (100), the one or more one or more electrical batteries (40, 41, 42, 43, 44, 45) are arranged inside the thermally insulated battery chamber (100).</p>
            </abstract>
